# T_SCRE: the location tree, the contents of shelf A1 with its help
# (CONTENTS) and, from F9 in the help box, the keys of every screen
# (KEYS), a new item preset to it (leaving it without a question, as the
# preset is no change of the user's), and the new location form inside
# the shelf, its type that of the bins already in it.
S LOCS
K DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN ENTER
S CONT
K F1
S HCONT
K F9
S HKEYS
K ESC INS
S NEWINLOC
K ESC ESC INS
S LOCNEW
K ESC ESC
